<Routine Name="STATUS" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATUS ROUTINE
***************************************************************************

STATUS OF PNC EXTEND CYLINDER SENSORS ARE DETERMINED IN EVENT TASK
(THIS CODE ALLOWS THE SENSORS TO BE MADE ON THE WAY TO BEING EXTENDED TO ACCOMADATE DIFFERENT STOPPING POSITIONS)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL1_EXT_PB) XIO(PNC_PICK_CYL1_RET) [XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL1_EXT) ,XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL1_EXT_DETECTED) ] OTE(PNC_PICK_CYL1_EXT_DETECTED) ,XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL2_EXT_PB) XIO(PNC_PICK_CYL2_RET) [XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL2_EXT) ,XIC(PNC_PICK_CYL2_EXT_DETECTED) ] OTE(PNC_PICK_CYL2_EXT_DETECTED) ,XIC(PNC_PRESS_CYL_EXT_PB) XIO(PNC_PRESS_CYL_RET) [XIC(PNC_PRESS_CYL_EXT) ,XIC(PNC_PRESS_CYL_EXT_DETECTED) ] OTE(PNC_PRESS_CYL_EXT_DETECTED) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
